{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Word Chain Solo or with a Friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect words that match the illustrations shown on the panels to create a word chain! Since there might be multiple words to describe each illustration, unexpected connections could emerge...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you play word chain by yourself, but you can also enjoy a versus mode with two players! Try to read your opponent's mind as you flip through the panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through as many panels as you can within the time limit and aim for a top ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/a76dfe45fe807bca37eaa0cd3631abb1.avif?t=1754401484\" data-has-big width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet &quot;Laby&quot; - Your Word Chain Buddy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your word chain companion is Laby, a squishy yellow robot who came from somewhere unknown. Laby is very knowledgeable and will teach you all sorts of words!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/348c24b4aa112efc5bca9172ee41ead3.avif?t=1754401484\" width=384 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Lots of New Words Through Word Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the &quot;Picture Dictionary,&quot; you can review all the illustrations and words you've uncovered from previous panels! The more words you collect, the easier it will become to make word chain connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/cc58844f3982ddc2e0db146213623734.avif?t=1754401484\" data-has-big width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friend Features (Coming Soon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend feature is planned for a future update. Compete with your friends and compare word chain scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/cc33e82efa5f356873e67c261868bf2c.avif?t=1754401484\" data-has-big width=1170 height=658 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3385250?t=1754401484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3385250?t=1754401484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/cf502550e3d0cf3fa1a2cf916103dc3223205f5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754401484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/cf502550e3d0cf3fa1a2cf916103dc3223205f5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754401484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Word Chain Solo or with a Friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect words that match the illustrations shown on the panels to create a word chain! Since there might be multiple words to describe each illustration, unexpected connections could emerge...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you play word chain by yourself, but you can also enjoy a versus mode with two players! Try to read your opponent's mind as you flip through the panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through as many panels as you can 